# Phase 9 OSD tour for `FH6_WheelDash --pad-script`: "<ms> <mask>" = hold mask (hex) from ms.
# View 0020, Menu 0010, D-pad up 0001 / down 0002 / left 0004 / right 0008, LB 0100, RB 0200.
# A/B/X/Y (F000) are never used; the tracker strips them anyway.
0 0000
# Hold View 600 ms: the hold toggle opens the OSD (Cluster tab).
3000 0020
3600 0000
# Down to the cluster carousel, two steps right (live view and thumbnails follow).
5000 0002
5100 0000
6000 0008
6100 0000
7000 0008
7100 0000
# RB to Colour, Right: colour mode Custom, Down x2 to Hue, hold Right 2.5 s (accelerating).
10000 0200
10100 0000
11000 0008
11100 0000
12000 0002
12100 0000
12400 0002
12500 0000
13000 0008
15500 0000
# RB x2 to Fit & camera, Down x5 to Cluster height, hold Right 1.5 s (cluster rises).
18000 0200
18100 0000
18600 0200
18700 0000
19500 0002
19600 0000
19800 0002
19900 0000
20100 0002
20200 0000
20400 0002
20500 0000
20700 0002
20800 0000
21500 0008
23000 0000
# RB to Controls.
25000 0200
25100 0000
# Tap View: back closes the OSD; the dash keeps the new cluster, colours and height.
27500 0020
27600 0000
